            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A pigeon? (कबूतर, kabūtar.) A parrot? (तोता, totā.) An owl? (उल्लू, ullū.) A butterfly? (तितली, titlī.) A fly? (मक्खी, makkhī.) A mosquito? (मच्छर, macchar.) An ant? (चींटी, cīṇṭī.) A frog? (मेंढक, meṇḍhak.) A tortoise? (कछुआ, kachuā.) A mouse? (चूहा, cūhā.) An elbow? (कोहनी, kohnī.) A wrist? (कलाई, kalāī.) A thumb? (अंगूठा, aṅgūṭhā.) A fingernail? (नाखून, nākhūn.) A cheek? (गाल, gāl.) The chin? (ठोड़ी, ṭhoṛī.) The tongue? (जीभ, jībh.) The neck? (गर्दन, gardan.) The chest? (छाती, chātī.) The waist? (कमर, kamar.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
